  "summary": "On hands and knees with the hands on the frame rails ahead of the carriage. The abdominals pull the knees — and the carriage — towards the wrists.",
  "steps": [
    "Kneel on the carriage with the knees behind the shoulder rests, hands on the metal rails.",
    "Walk the hands along the rails until the carriage has moved away from its stopper and you are on hands and knees.",
    "Breathe out to draw the knees and carriage towards the wrists.",
    "Breathe in to let the knees return under the hips."
